{"src":"zh","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":166000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"zh","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5872.788157,"text":"然而在这方面,深耕区有点像一个国家"},{"kind":"text","t":6554.96565,"text":"However, in this regard, the deep-cultivation zone is somewhat like a country."},{"kind":"audio","t":6664.44123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6669.052618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":6674.117098000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6679.458494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":6679.8738379999995,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":12308.006449,"text":"该洞穴坐落在麦加北部的一座山顶上,与外界完全隔绝。"},{"kind":"text","t":13099.74238,"text":"The cave is situated on a mountaintop north of Mecca, completely isolated from the outside world."},{"kind":"audio","t":13216.808251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13222.277525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13227.255047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13232.81154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13239.687762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":13240.701196,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":18198.442439,"text":"人们现在在电脑屏幕上写信息 永远不必接触卷笔刀了"},{"kind":"text","t":18915.844648,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens and never have to touch a pencil sharpener again."},{"kind":"audio","t":19024.118057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19029.219187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":19034.217109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19039.519575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19044.639995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":19044.896291,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29715.481596999998,"text":"前往科征重税的国家地区的旅客有时可以省下一大笔钱 在这些地方购买油水或烟草的产品特别划算"},{"kind":"text","t":30906.028466,"text":"Travelers visiting countries with high taxes can sometimes save a lot of money; it is particularly cost-effective to buy oil or tobacco products in these places."},{"kind":"audio","t":31012.563339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31017.808667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31022.961636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31028.245894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":31030.244882,"samples":14128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":31109.260306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31114.301287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31119.319578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":31124.638475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31126.117062,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":35318.31836,"text":"植物通过光合作用从阳光中获取养分,它们还能提供阴凉。"},{"kind":"text","t":35915.513215,"text":"Plants obtain nutrients from sunlight through photosynthesis, and they also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":36030.270689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":36031.551369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36032.995907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36034.575422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36035.163963,"samples":20128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":42068.920853,"text":"医院遵循了感染控制规定 包括把患者与他人隔离"},{"kind":"text","t":42625.330336,"text":"The hospital followed infection control regulations, including isolating patients from others."},{"kind":"audio","t":42744.927974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42750.351159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42755.566538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42760.970143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42766.768543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":42767.045978,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":44341.712547,"text":"以防感染到其他人"},{"kind":"text","t":44576.795518,"text":"to prevent infecting others"},{"kind":"audio","t":44680.23654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44684.174638,"samples":30232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":54124.201295,"text":"完成的工作大多是理论性的 但编写程序的目的是为了模拟对人马做新细的观测"},{"kind":"text","t":55077.370099,"text":"Most of the work completed is theoretical, but the purpose of writing the program is to simulate detailed observations of humans and horses."},{"kind":"audio","t":55200.847147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55206.167034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55211.415982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55216.961385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":55222.457049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55227.814335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55232.219396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":55232.572041,"samples":8824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68653.11648800001,"text":"巴塞罗那的官方语言为加泰罗尼亚语和西班牙语 大概一半的当地人更愿意说加泰罗尼亚语 绝大多数人都听得懂加泰罗尼亚语"},{"kind":"text","t":69775.21485900001,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half of the locals prefer to speak Catalan, and the vast majority of people understand it."},{"kind":"audio","t":69886.094884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69893.107294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":69898.464921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69900.90017200001,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":69985.08743500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69990.45440100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69995.559701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70001.202483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70005.66869300001,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":70407.890599,"text":"至于西班牙语几乎每个人都能听懂"},{"kind":"text","t":70871.05353100001,"text":"As for Spanish, almost everyone can understand it."},{"kind":"audio","t":70980.185503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70985.40058100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70990.504562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":70990.822627,"samples":1296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75168.279785,"text":"在某些地区,水煮一分钟就足够了,在其他地区则需要几分钟的时间。"},{"kind":"text","t":75973.626583,"text":"In some areas, boiling for one minute is enough, while in others, it takes several minutes."},{"kind":"audio","t":76088.995637,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76094.033339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76099.118809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76104.511895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76107.20954200001,"samples":21328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":84505.08510800001,"text":"植物在自然环境中状态最好 因此要抵住诱惑 不要去摘掉植物 哪怕只是一株"},{"kind":"text","t":85375.71926400001,"text":"Plants are at their best in their natural environment, so resist the temptation to pick them, even just one."},{"kind":"audio","t":85491.495422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85496.495804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85501.537035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85506.763923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85511.78004400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":85513.859142,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":92354.57224400001,"text":"在20世纪20年代 大多市民的主流态度是和平主义的 分离主义的"},{"kind":"text","t":93195.907539,"text":"In the 1920s, the mainstream attitude of most citizens was pacifist and separatist."},{"kind":"audio","t":93310.67797300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93315.472288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93320.959142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93326.17027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93331.12870300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":93331.43297800001,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98666.275315,"text":"苍龙是那个时代的顶级热识者 除了同类他什么都不怕"},{"kind":"text","t":99506.95724,"text":"Canglong was a top enthusiast of that era; he feared nothing except those of his own kind."},{"kind":"audio","t":99610.88221400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":99616.32947800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99618.48384500001,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":99694.349927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99699.183602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99701.88239900001,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":104341.03242300001,"text":"自从1537年亚松森建成以来"},{"kind":"text","t":104863.455038,"text":"Since the founding of Asunción in 1537"},{"kind":"audio","t":104964.559716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104969.745655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":104974.497321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":104974.773226,"samples":96,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":109714.347099,"text":"巴拉圭一直设法保留了这座城的许多本土特色和特性"},{"kind":"text","t":110471.85580500001,"text":"Paraguay has always managed to preserve many of the city's indigenous characteristics and features."},{"kind":"audio","t":110591.44541300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110596.76611000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110603.456925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":110608.88563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":110614.38014400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":110614.523302,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":114710.419357,"text":"猪携带钙级饼然后通过蚊子传染给人类"},{"kind":"text","t":115438.03443100001,"text":"Pigs carry the calcium-level cake, which is then transmitted to humans via mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":115545.552009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115550.64666900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":115555.909857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115561.37080100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115565.38710800001,"samples":28528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":122840.33161600001,"text":"大多数现代科研望远镜都是巨型设施"},{"kind":"text","t":123216.04388600001,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are giant facilities."},{"kind":"audio","t":123323.04903200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123328.38027800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123333.895862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":123334.21355700001,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127580.844293,"text":"位于大气条件优良的偏远地区"},{"kind":"text","t":127983.79147800001,"text":"Located in remote areas with excellent atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":128094.39482700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128099.62019500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":128104.984651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128108.89608,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":133974.16822700002,"text":"人们可能想不到,旅行者在回程中也需要耐心和理解。"},{"kind":"text","t":134613.745199,"text":"One might not realize that travelers also need patience and understanding on their return journey."},{"kind":"audio","t":134721.301875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134726.547123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134731.781691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":134737.121458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134742.414025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":134742.690031,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":139353.166773,"text":"因此,很可能这个符号就是作为一个标签添加的。"},{"kind":"text","t":139971.601306,"text":"Therefore, it is very likely that this symbol was added as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":140081.698623,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140087.01577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140092.339136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140094.482863,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":144880.017966,"text":"但鸟类还是有很多地方和恐龙相似"},{"kind":"text","t":145289.61085700002,"text":"But birds still have many similarities to dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":145389.801989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":145395.332402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145400.434262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":145400.722038,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":153880.990394,"text":"这里几乎都是沙滩,游泳很安全,大部分地方都有新西兰圣诞树的树荫。"},{"kind":"text","t":154812.788482,"text":"It's almost all beach here, swimming is very safe, and most areas are shaded by New Zealand Christmas trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":154928.308495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154929.850821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154931.292458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154932.930392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154934.543897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154935.524232,"samples":26360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":165344.382348,"text":"杜瓦尔已婚,有两个已经成年的孩子,他并没有给故事的讲述者米勒留下太大印象。"},{"kind":"text","t":166325.445876,"text":"Duval is married and has two adult children; he didn't leave much of an impression on the narrator, Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":166431.726873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166437.595941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166439.57295,"samples":19064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":166519.173734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166524.74685700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166529.95686500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":166530.087013,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":176605.499757,"code":1005}]}